  "description": "Yeo Chae-Woon, the top student in his department, constantly draws attention for his exceptional grades and striking looks. Unfortunately for him, that attention is nothing but a nuisance. When the new semester begins, an unknown stalker starts following him, turning his once-quiet campus life into a constant source of anxiety. Searching for a way out, Chae-Woon comes up with an unexpected idea. He approaches Bae Joo-Han, a classmate from the same department who has been persistently flirting with him, and makes a proposal. For a limited time, they will pretend to be lovers.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
